"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p008:m0090"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南史卷十一明言瓊之父道慶。南史卷二十一另稱太后兄慶之孫，慶之另有現役人物號。"},{"id":"0ej_lsn_fpk_C","label":"路氏（宋前廢帝皇后，道慶女）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"路氏","mention_ids":["c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context:p001:m0006"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-007","source_id":"s-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context-ws2368147","chapter_id":"c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context:p001","quote":"路氏","mention_id":"c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context:p001:m0006"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"卷十一及宋書卷四十一均言道慶女為皇后；前廢帝紀明書立皇后路氏。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi011-luhuinan-m-lu-empress-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-luhuinan-ws2288359","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004","quote":"先是，晉安王子勳未平，巫者謂宜開昭太后陵，毀去梓宮以厭勝。修復倉卒，不得如禮。上性忌，慮將來致災，泰始四年夏，詔有司曰：「崇憲昭太后修甯陵地，大明之世，久所考卜。前歲遭諸蕃之難，禮從權宜，未暇營改，而塋隧之所，山原卑陋，可式遵舊典，以禮改創。」有司奏請「修甯陵玄宮補葺毀壞，權施油殿，暫出梓宮，事畢即窆」。詔可。廢帝景和中，又追贈興之侍中、金紫光祿大夫，諡曰孝侯。道慶光祿大夫、開府儀同三司，諡曰敬侯。道慶女為皇后，以休之為侍中。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004:r0203","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004:m0201","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004","surface":"道慶女","start":201,"end":204}}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"道慶之女為皇后，宋前廢帝本紀另有立后之日。","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context-ws2368147","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-007","chapter_id":"c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context:p001:m0006"],"paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context:p001:m0006","mention_ids":["c-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context:p001:m0006"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-songshu-007-lu-empress-accession-context-ws2368147"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-nanshi011-luhuinan-m-lu-empress-father","subject_person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk_C","object_person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"道慶女","nanshi011_luhuinan_reading":"m-lu-empress-father","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-luhuinan-ws2288359","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004","quote":"先是，晉安王子勳未平，巫者謂宜開昭太后陵，毀去梓宮以厭勝。修復倉卒，不得如禮。上性忌，慮將來致災，泰始四年夏，詔有司曰：「崇憲昭太后修甯陵地，大明之世，久所考卜。前歲遭諸蕃之難，禮從權宜，未暇營改，而塋隧之所，山原卑陋，可式遵舊典，以禮改創。」有司奏請「修甯陵玄宮補葺毀壞，權施油殿，暫出梓宮，事畢即窆」。詔可。廢帝景和中，又追贈興之侍中、金紫光祿大夫，諡曰孝侯。道慶光祿大夫、開府儀同三司，諡曰敬侯。道慶女為皇后，以休之為侍中。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004:r0203","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004:m0201","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004","surface":"道慶女","start":201,"end":204}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"道慶之女為皇后，宋前廢帝本紀另有立后之日。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanshi011-luhuinan-s-lu-empress-father","subject_person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk_C","object_person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"道慶女","nanshi011_luhuinan_reading":"s-lu-empress-father","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-luhuinan-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p008","quote":"瓊之為衡陽內史，先后卒。廢帝景和中，以休之為黃門侍郎，茂之左軍將軍，並封開國縣侯，邑千戶。又追贈興之侍中、金紫光祿大夫，諡曰孝侯；道慶散騎常侍、光祿大夫、開府儀同三司，諡曰敬侯。立道慶女為皇后，以休之為侍中，茂之黃門郎。太宗廢幼主，欲說太后之心，乃下令書曰：「太皇太后蚤垂愛遇，沿情即事，同於天屬。前車騎諮議參軍路休之、前丹陽丞路茂之，崇憲密戚，蚤延榮貫，並懷所勳，宜殊恒飾。休之可黃門侍郎，領步兵校尉；茂之可中書侍郎。」太宗未即位，故稱令書。茂之又遷司徒從事中郎，休之桂陽王休範鎮北諮議參軍。太宗殺世祖諸子，因此陷休之等，宥其諸子。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p008:r0092","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p008:m0090","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p008","surface":"道慶女","start":90,"end":93}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"道慶之女為皇后，宋前廢帝本紀另有立后之日。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi011-luhuinan-m-lu-empress-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-luhuinan-ws2288359","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004","quote":"先是，晉安王子勳未平，巫者謂宜開昭太后陵，毀去梓宮以厭勝。修復倉卒，不得如禮。上性忌，慮將來致災，泰始四年夏，詔有司曰：「崇憲昭太后修甯陵地，大明之世，久所考卜。前歲遭諸蕃之難，禮從權宜，未暇營改，而塋隧之所，山原卑陋，可式遵舊典，以禮改創。」有司奏請「修甯陵玄宮補葺毀壞，權施油殿，暫出梓宮，事畢即窆」。詔可。廢帝景和中，又追贈興之侍中、金紫光祿大夫，諡曰孝侯。道慶光祿大夫、開府儀同三司，諡曰敬侯。道慶女為皇后，以休之為侍中。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004:r0203","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p004:m0201","rela